    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n*   Start by giving the AI a very short, simple prompt (e.g., 3 words long) to generate some text.\r\n*   Expand your initial prompt to be a bit longer (e.g., around 10 words) by adding more specific details or instructions, and see how the AI's response changes.\r\n*   Further expand your prompt (e.g., around 20 words), perhaps by giving the AI a specific persona or role to write from, like a 'Campaign Manager' or 'Social Media Content Creator'.\r\n*   Compare the different responses you receive and think about what made the AI's output change with each new prompt.\r\n*   Discuss with the bot how varying the detail and length of your prompts impacts the AI's generated text.",
